#. the title of a mission, on its card
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Oil for Monopoli"
msgstr "Aceite para Monopoli"

#. the summary of a mission, one or two short sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Count hoards the olive oil. Trade salt for pressing mats, the mats for oil, and bring it to "
"the market of Bari."
msgstr ""
"El conde acapara el aceite de oliva. Cambiad sal por capachos, los capachos por aceite, y llevadlo"
" al mercado de Bari."

#. a fun fact at the end of a mission, at most three sentences
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In Apulia, many olive mills were dug into the rock under the ground. It was warm down there in "
"winter, so the oil flowed better."
msgstr ""
"En Apulia, muchas almazaras se excavaban en la roca, bajo tierra. Allí abajo hacía calor en "
"invierno, y así el aceite corría mejor."

#. the headline of the screen at the end of a mission, a few words
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fair oil for Bari!"
msgstr "¡Aceite justo para Bari!"

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "Salt, mats and a lot of sailing beat the Count's prices."
msgstr "La sal, los capachos y mucho navegar vencieron los precios del conde."

#. what the crew achieved, on the screen at the end of a mission, one sentence
#: data/missions/23_oil_for_monopoli/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
msgid "The kitchens of Bari smell of fresh oil."
msgstr "Las cocinas de Bari huelen a aceite nuevo."

#. a line which a person says, at most two short sentences
#: data/missions/24_count_flees/mission.tres
#, fuzzy
